	(text "Sense: ISEN = mean of the four source nodes, VSEN = true 4-wire difference amplifier"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 22.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 4.5 4.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 40 90 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e1a43cff-fda0-58ed-9b65-b0a9a5694557")
	)
	(text "Both outputs are scaled for the 4.096 V ADC range and clamped to +5V_ISO. Offsets are deliberate and calibrated out in firmware."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 26.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1a4a2999-c06a-5012-a212-ae5fec74b810")
	)
	(text "Gain 12 (R43 / R42 + 1, 1 %: up to 2 % gain error, removed by the 2-point calibration).\nR41 injects +12 mV at the input (= +0.15 V out), kept from Rev C: a zero calibration removes\nit. Full scale 3.22 V at 10.24 A, 0.4 mA per ADS1118 LSB. U12A, standard quad pinout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 131.95 131.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4329f505-03ae-5631-bbdc-aaa7de6e5927")
	)
	(text "A   ISEN: 0.300 V/A + 0.15 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127.73 55.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b1a7787d-abe4-55d9-b73d-80c806bffe0b")
	)
	(text "VSEN = 0.049 x (SENSE_P - SENSE_N) + 0.10 V: 2.5 mV of DUT per LSB, clips at 65 V.\nR45 and R48 see 60 V: 1206. 1 % resistors: up to 2 % gain error (calibrated out) and\nCMRR about 40 dB, harmless because SENSE_N sits within millivolts of AGND. R49 feeds\nback to -IN (Rev B had it on +IN and latched). VSEN_OA also feeds CV and OVP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 131.95 225.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fa76c394-aaf1-51f1-ad21-4c75ca0e4994")
	)
	(text "B   VSEN: 0.049 V/V + 0.10 V, true 4-wire"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 126.46 145.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
